OL,3,AMurder probe after wildfire uncovers
OL,4,Abody in park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA murder investigation is under way
OL,7,Fafter human bones were uncovered at a
OL,8,Fwest London park following a wildfire,
OL,9,Fthe Metropolitan Police said.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to
OL,12,FBedfont Lakes Country Park in Hounslow
OL,13,Fat about 18:35 BST on Wednesday, 12
OL,14,FAugust.
OL,16,FA police spokesperson said the remains
OL,17,Fwere found by a member of the public
OL,18,Fafter the wildfire affected an area of
OL,19,Fwoodland known as The Pits.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
