OL,3,ARussian double-tap drone strike kills
OL,4,A15 in Ukrainian mall, officials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FDramatic footage verified by the BBC
OL,7,Fshows the second drone hitting the
OL,8,Falready burning shopping centre in the
OL,9,FDnipropetrovsk region. Russia's
OL,10,Fmilitary has not commented.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
