OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AUK, Canada and Australia condemn Israel
OL,4,Afor refusing criminal probe into aid
OL,5,Aworker killings in Gaza
OL,6,
OL,7,FA joint statement by the three foreign
OL,8,Fministries said: "The victims of this
OL,9,Fincident and their families deserve
OL,10,Fjustice and accountability, and we will
OL,11,Fcontinue to seek answers on their
OL,12,Fbehalf."
OL,14,FEarlier, Israel's ambassador to
OL,15,FAustralia, Hillel Newman, defended the
OL,16,Fdecision, saying "there was no criminal
OL,17,Fintention" and therefore "no criminal
OL,18,Fresponsibility".
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
